relative-time></div>\n<div data-testid=\"comment-header-right-side-items\"><span id=\"comment-association\" data-testid=\"comment-author-association\">Maintainer of the example project</span><button id=\"edit-history\" aria-label=\"Last edited by Fixture Comment Author\">Last edited by Fixture Comment Author</button><button id=\"comment-actions\" aria-label=\"Comment actions\">Comment actions</button></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\"><div class=\"markdown-body\" id=\"comment-body\"><p id=\"comment-paragraph\">This separate comment explains the expected behavior and preserves <a id=\"comment-link\" href=\"/FixtureCommentAuthor\">an ordinary author mention</a>.</p><pre id=\"comment-code\"><code>const original = iterator.next();</code></pre></div></div></li>\n<li data-timeline-event-id=\"example-closed\"><div><a id=\"event-actor\" data-testid=\"actor-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" href=\"/FixtureEventActor\"><img alt=\"\"><span id=\"event-name\">Fixture Event Actor</span></a><span id=\"event-prose\">closed the example after the complete discussion</span><relative-time>yesterday</relative-time></div></li>\n<li data-timeline-event-id=\"example-locked\"><div><a id=\"bot-actor\" data-testid=\"actor-link\" href=\"/apps/fixture-automation\"><img alt=\"\"><span id=\"bot-name\">Fixture Automation Bot</span></a><span>locked this issue</span></div></li>\n<li id=\"contaminated-header\" data-testid=\"comment-header\"><div class=\"markdown-body\"><p id=\"nested-body\">A full body nested in a lookalike header must remain readable.</p></div><p id=\"mixed-prose\">A sibling paragraph in that mixed component also remains readable.</p></li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" id=\"markdown-root-lookalike\" data-testid=\"comment-header\"><p id=\"root-body\">The Markdown root itself is never an identity header.</p></div>\n<div id=\"near-misses\"><a id=\"ordinary-profile\" href=\"/FixtureIssueAuthor\">An ordinary profile link remains readable prose</a><a id=\"missing-